{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572310/extras/add_to_your_wishlist.png?t=1745143864\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Match the Babies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By day, you\u2019re stationed in the Maternity Ward, where your sole duty is to reunite newborns with their rightful parents using a simplified genetics puzzle. One tiny slip can send your career \u2014 and a family\u2019s future \u2014 into a tailspin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572310/extras/gif_1.png?t=1745143864\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Navigate the Narrative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beyond the nursery\u2019s sterile halls, secret societies, power-hungry inspectors, and wary colleagues slip you letters and hushed demands. Every decision shapes not only your workday, but the destiny of a repressive regime on the brink of upheaval.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572310/extras/gif_2.png?t=1745143864\" />Survive or Thrive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your accuracy pays the bills. Scrape by on meager wages, or aim higher: bribe officials, climb the state bureaucracy, and furnish a better apartment. Yet the higher you rise, the greater the risk. Will you remain an obedient cog, join the conspiracy, or become just another casualty of ruthless politics? The choice is yours.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3572310?t=1745143864","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3572310?t=1745143864","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572310/12de14567f377104fb9c0f712992bba1eb866562/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745143864","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i